			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">This interface is used to optimize the energy available in the vehicle. This interface provides the information whether all, basic or only keep-alive components/functionalities are allowed to run.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
