			<SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			  <SHORT-NAME>EmTqDynJ1</SHORT-NAME>
			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Electric Machine Dynamic Moment of Inertia</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Inertia torque of the electric machine at clutch level.&#13;
&#13;
Definition of the sign:&#13;
Increasing speed creates a negative sign, decreasing speed creates a positive sign.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <INTRODUCTION>
				<P>
				  <L-1 L="EN">The signal contains the dynamic torque created by the inertia of the electric machine which, on parallel hybrid projects, increases or decreases the torque at clutch.</L-1>
				</P>
			  </INTRODUCTION>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
			  <DATA-ELEMENTS>
				<VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
				  <SHORT-NAME>EmTqDynJ</SHORT-NAME>
				  <LONG-NAME>
					<L-4 L="EN">Electric Machine Dynamic Moment of Inertia</L-4>
				  </LONG-NAME>
				  <TYPE-TREF BASE="ApplicationDataTypes" DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">Tq5</TYPE-TREF>
				</VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
			  </DATA-ELEMENTS>
			</SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
