			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Provides the information whether a certain exterior light function is on or off. As long as the function is on (activated), the value "on" should be provided. This interface can be used e.g. to provide feedback to the driver via Man Machine Interface (MMI). This is considered as a status signal, which carries continuously a certain value as long as its semantic condition is present.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
