			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Mirror Move Automatic Request</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Request to move the mirror automatically to a certain position. This position could be determined by a user request from the mirror panel, an access from the remote key, a keyless access or if reverse gear was detected, to down outer mirror angle to provide the best view to the curb.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
