			  <SHORT-NAME>OutpMplSt256</SHORT-NAME>
			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Multi State Output 256 States</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">System output to user: The value is used to generate feedback to the user about the system's current state. The value represents one of 256 states, mutually excluding each other, the system can be in or has changed to.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
