			<SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			  <SHORT-NAME>RlySplyH2BlowrOnConsold1</SHORT-NAME>
			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Consolidated Value for Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower: Consolidated physical value, either a measured
value or a modeled value.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <INTRODUCTION>
				<P>
				  <L-1 L="EN">Finally filtered and offset corrected, consolidated value. Virtual physical sensor value that comes as close as possible to the technical signal. In case of inability to provide a physical sensor value (e.g. failure, implausibility or other reasons) a substitute  value or a default value or a frozen value is provided.</L-1>
				</P>
			  </INTRODUCTION>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
			  <DATA-ELEMENTS>
				<VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
				  <SHORT-NAME>RlySplyH2BlowrOnConsold1</SHORT-NAME>
				  <LONG-NAME>
					<L-4 L="EN">Consolidated Value for Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower</L-4>
				  </LONG-NAME>
				  <DESC>
					<L-2 L="EN">Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower: Consolidated physical value, either a measured
value or a modeled value.</L-2>
				  </DESC>
				  <INTRODUCTION>
					<P>
					  <L-1 L="EN">Finally filtered and offset corrected, consolidated value. Virtual physical sensor value that comes as close as possible to the technical signal. In case of inability to provide a physical sensor value (e.g. failure, implausibility or other reasons) a substitute  value or a default value or a frozen value is provided.</L-1>
					</P>
				  </INTRODUCTION>
				  <TYPE-TREF BASE="ApplicationDataTypes" DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">Boolean</TYPE-TREF>
				</VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
			  </DATA-ELEMENTS>
			</SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			<SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			  <SHORT-NAME>RlySplyH2BlowrOnCpby1</SHORT-NAME>
			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Capability for Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower: The dynamic instant capability.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <INTRODUCTION>
				<P>
				  <L-1 L="EN">The dynamic instant capability is based on output limitation but could also
contain the limitation on the rate of change of the consolidated value.</L-1>
				</P>
			  </INTRODUCTION>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
