			</SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			<SENDER-RECEIVER-INTERFACE>
			  <SHORT-NAME>RlySplyH2BlowrOnOutp1</SHORT-NAME>
			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Output Value for Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Switch on supply relay for the hydrogen recirculation blower: Final controller output.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <INTRODUCTION>
				<P>
				  <L-1 L="EN">The output value includes the necessary control actions to reach the requested setpoint in the given system conditions. For example for realizing the requested actuator position a pre-control impulse to overcome the static friction is needed. In the case of a smart actuator, the output value might add a dedicated initialization duty cycle to wake up the actuator.</L-1>
				</P>
			  </INTRODUCTION>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
			  <DATA-ELEMENTS>
				<VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
				  <SHORT-NAME>RlySplyH2BlowrOnOutp1</SHORT-NAME>
