			  <LONG-NAME>
				<L-4 L="EN">Consolidated Value for Air temperature upstream high pressure compressor</L-4>
			  </LONG-NAME>
			  <DESC>
				<L-2 L="EN">Air temperature upstream high pressure compressor: Consolidated physical value, either a measured
value or a modeled value.</L-2>
			  </DESC>
			  <INTRODUCTION>
				<P>
				  <L-1 L="EN">Finally filtered and offset corrected, consolidated value. Virtual physical sensor value that comes as close as possible to the technical signal. In case of inability to provide a physical sensor value (e.g. failure, implausibility or other reasons) a substitute  value or a default value or a frozen value is provided.</L-1>
				</P>
			  </INTRODUCTION>
			  <IS-SERVICE>false</IS-SERVICE>
			  <DATA-ELEMENTS>
				<VARIABLE-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
